0:21.510" end="00:21.750">with </span><span begin="00:21.750" end="00:22.830">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.100" end="00:27.720"><span begin="00:23.100" end="00:23.340">Is </span><span begin="00:23.340" end="00:23.460">it </span><span begin="00:23.460" end="00:23.790">too </span><span begin="00:23.790" end="00:24.150">late </span><span begin="00:24.150" end="00:24.300">to </span><span begin="00:24.300" end="00:24.750">pursue</span><span begin="00:24.750" end="00:27.720">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.720" end="00:30.750"><span begin="00:27.720" end="00:28.020">I </span><span begin="00:28.020" end="00:28.440">bite </span><span begin="00:28.440" end="00:28.740">my </span><span begin="00:28.740" end="00:29.220">tongue</span><span begin="00:29.220" end="00:29.220">, </span><span begin="00:29.220" end="00:29.400">it's </span><span begin="00:29.400" end="00:29.490">a </span><span begin="00:29.490" end="00:30.150">bad </span><span begin="00:30.150" end="00:30.750">habit</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.150" end="00:36.510"><span begin="00:33.150" end="00:33.720">Kinda </span><span begin="00:33.720" end="00:34.110">mad </span><span begin="00:34.110" end="00:34.380">that </span><span begin="00:34.380" end="00:34.440">I </span><span begin="00:34.440" end="00:34.800">didn't </span><span begin="00:34.800" end="00:35.100">take </span><span begin="00:35.100" end="00:35.160">a </span><span begin="00:35.160" end="00:35.970">stab </span><span begin="00:35.970" end="00:36.180">at </span><span begin="00:36.180" end="00:36.510">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.540" end="00:39.330"><span begin="00:36.540" end="00:37.020">Thought </span><span begin="00:37.020" end="00:37.170">you </span><span begin="00:37.170" end="00:37.290">were </span><span begin="00:37.290" end="00:37.620">too </span><span begin="00:37.620" end="00:37.860">good </span><span begin="00:37.860" end="00:38.040">for </span><span begin="00:38.040" end="00:38.250">me</span><span begin="00:38.250" end="00:38.250">, </span><span begin="00:38.250" end="00:38.550">my </span><span begin="00:38.550" end="00:39.330">dear</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.360" end="00:42.210"><span begin="00:39.360" end="00:39.780">Never </span><span begin="00:39.780" end="00:40.170">gave </span><span begin="00:40.170" end="00:40.320">me </span><span begin="00:40.320" end="00:40.770">time </span><span begin="00:40.770" end="00:40.860">of </span><span begin="00:40.860" end="00:41.130">day</span><span begin="00:41.130" end="00:41.130">, </span><span begin="00:41.130" end="00:41.400">my </span><span begin="00:41.400" end="00:42.210">dear</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.270" end="00:45.060"><span begin="00:42.270" end="00:42.720">It's </span><span begin="00:42.720" end="00:43.290">okay</span><span begin="00:43.290" end="00:43.290">, </span><span begin="00:43.290" end="00:43.740">things </span><span begin="00:43.740" end="00:44.220">happen </span><span begin="00:44.220" end="00:45.060">for</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.120" end="00:48.480"><span begin="00:45.120" end="00:45.840">Reasons </span><span begin="00:45.840" end="00:46.290">that </span><span begin="00:46.290" end="00:46.500">I </span><span begin="00:46.500" end="00:46.860">think </span><span begin="00:46.860" end="00:47.010">are </span><span begin="00:47.010" end="00:47.610">sure</span><span begin="00:47.610" end="00:47.610">, </span><span begin="00:47.610" end="00:48.480">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.480" end="00:54.120"><span begin="00:48.480" end="00:48.720">I </span><span begin="00:48.720" end="00:49.110">wish </span><span begin="00:49.110" end="00:49.260">I </span><span begin="00:49.260" end="00:50.520">knew</span><span begin="00:50.520" end="00:51.150">, </span><span begin="00:51.150" end="00:51.480">I </span><span begin="00:51.480" end="00:51.960">wish </span><span begin="00:51.960" end="00:52.140">I </span><span begin="00:52.140" end="00:52.710">knew </span><